  "summary": "Implemented the EXTERNAL-REPO-RESOLUTION Phase 1 layer from automation/acceptance/external-repo-resolution.yaml without modifying the accepted contract. Added a shared read-only resolver that resolves the governance repository separately from external experiment/evidence repositories; external repositories resolve only through the tracked portable registry plus the gitignored machine-local override, with no sibling-folder inference. The resolver verifies local Git worktree identity, exact origin remote URL, full 40-character HEAD SHA, required repository-relative paths, dirty-worktree policy, allowed evidence roots, absolute-path rejection, traversal rejection, and symlink-escape rejection via realpath before any evidence read. Added the tracked zero-config registry, safe local override example, .gitignore protection for the real override, registry validator, and 30 synthetic temporary-Git-repository pytest cases. Existing same-repository behavior is preserved in zero-config mode; scan_artifacts.py, result_explorer.py, and update_dashboard.py were integrated only for governance-root/full-SHA/repository-aware compatibility. No real local override was created, no Research OS files were migrated or copied, no external repository was modified, no experiment/pilot/training/validation/evaluation/export/threshold selection was run, no experiment queue or protocol/candidate record was changed, and no held-out-test data was read.",
